{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "两包对比:入参 eco / pkg(A)、eco2 / pkg2(B)。两个包各取 30 天逐日(同关注列表的取数槽),折线共用纵轴。只挂一个照常出数。组件的流不做缓存(§5.5 契约 5)。",
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uY",
        "value": "亿"
      },
      "_note": "中文量级单位落成键再引用:表达式里不直接写汉字(与半角逗号混在一个串里,文案闸会误报)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uW",
        "value": "万"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "i0e",
        "value": "${eco}"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 入参落地(勿删):方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "i0n",
        "value": "${pkg}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "i1e",
        "value": "${eco2}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "i1n",
        "value": "${pkg2}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "e0",
        "value": "$[toLowerCase::(findNotEmpty::(${i0e},npm))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n0",
        "value": "${i0n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "has0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${n0}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},crates),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},pypi),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "m0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${c0},1),0,if::(eq::(${y0},1),0,1)),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${m0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rN0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/range/last-year/${n0}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${y0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rP0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://pypistats.org/api/packages/$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]/overall",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "mirrors": "false"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${c0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rC0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]/downloads",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable-pkgstats/1 (+https://numable.app)",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${y0},1),if::(gt::(length::(${rP0.data}),0),0,1),0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "sleep",
          "params": {
            "timestamp": "1500"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rP0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://pypistats.org/api/packages/$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]/overall",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "mirrors": "false"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "pypistats 偶发 429:隔 1.5 秒重试一次。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_c0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "e1",
        "value": "$[toLowerCase::(findNotEmpty::(${i1e},npm))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n1",
        "value": "${i1n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "has1",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${n1}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has1},1),if::(eq::(${e1},crates),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has1},1),if::(eq::(${e1},pypi),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
